  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nOnce upon a time there was an old mother pig who had one hundred little pigs and not enough food to feed them. So when they were old enough, she sent them out into the world to seek their fortunes. You know the story about the first three little pigs. This is a story about the 92nd little pig.\n\nThe 92nd little pig built a house out of depleted uranium. And the wolf was like, \"dude.\"  \"Don't you think you're getting a little carried away?\" The pig eyed the wolf's nearby 120mm smoothbore cannon. \"No, 'dude.' I think this is just about right.\" \n\nSo the wolf was like, \"Alright, you asked for it.  I'm gonna shoot, and shoot, and shoot this cannon until I blow your house down.\" And that's just what he did. He shot, and he shot, and he shot that cannon, for days on end, but the depleted uranium house wouldn't even dent. The wolf shrugged. \"Back to the drawing board.\"",
